{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "This Reno is a pretty nice guy!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Yes. He is a dear friend of mine.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 13,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "And he will make a great king.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 12,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Bob, you know you can return to your troops, right? You don't HAVE to stay with us.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 13,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "And leave you unprotected?! You are in a dire need of my strength, pupil! What can you do without me?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 12,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Moving on. What do you think the new king will do?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I think his first command will be to do everything he can to stop the war, but that won't be easy.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 13,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "That's for sure.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "How come? Kira, I don't think your old man, the one in Occidens, wants to keep the war going, does he?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "No, Dad wants the war to stop. Giving an order and signing a treaty will be the easy part.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "The hard part is what comes after, the hatred our people have for each other...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 13,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Hold on... Kira Albarn?! As in Darius Albarn?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 12,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Yes, I'm his adoptive daughter.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "So... Pupils, so you're all really from Occidens?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 12,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Huh, surprise?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Ah... Bob fainted.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 0
        }
    ]
}